25
00:02:11,302 --> 00:02:17,327
[SPEAKER_00]: But the fall of that year, they sold me to the Cincinnati Club, which then operated at Columbus, Ohio.

26
00:02:18,488 --> 00:02:19,609
[SPEAKER_00]: See, that was 1928.

27
00:02:19,669 --> 00:02:24,253
