28
00:02:24,645 --> 00:02:27,388
[SPEAKER_00]: and had a real good ending of the season.

29
00:02:27,908 --> 00:02:33,554
[SPEAKER_00]: So the next year, they sent me a contract to play with the Columbus Baseball Club.

30
