58
00:04:42,586 --> 00:04:55,892
[SPEAKER_00]: Bert Shotton was our manager at the time, plus the coaches that they had, whom I don't remember, and they handed me a contract at that time, I think it was about $400 a month, and to me that was a lot of money, 1926.

59
