62
00:05:06,083 --> 00:05:09,564
[SPEAKER_00]: I didn't have any idea that I could, which fortunate enough I did.

63
00:05:09,584 --> 00:05:12,405
[SPEAKER_00]: I did make it and I'm very happy.

64
00:05:12,425 --> 00:05:13,906
[SPEAKER_01]: Was your family happy about it too?

65
00:05:13,946 --> 00:05:24,529
