66
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:39,289
[SPEAKER_00]: So finally when I told him what I was going to get, well he agreed, he let me go and play and from there on I stayed in baseball all approximately, well I'd say from 26 to 1969 is when I really retired, yeah.

67
