[SPEAKER_01]: Your father, did your father come over from Italy then?

68
00:05:43,372 --> 00:05:47,274
[SPEAKER_00]: No, he was here at the turn of the century, yes, when he first come over.

69
00:05:48,175 --> 00:05:50,216
[SPEAKER_00]: They're originally from Naples, Italy and we had a little

70
00:05:50,827 --> 00:05:58,575
