71
00:05:58,875 --> 00:06:01,958
[SPEAKER_01]: Did he or you ever get back to your native country?

72
00:06:01,998 --> 00:06:03,320
[SPEAKER_00]: No, I never have.

73
00:06:03,380 --> 00:06:09,466
[SPEAKER_00]: I had brothers that went over and my father never went back, neither did my mother, but I've never been over there at all, no.

74
00:06:10,847 --> 00:06:14,110
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay, well then, you had this $400

75
00:06:15,452 --> 00:06:17,472
[SPEAKER_00]: That's when I first started, yes.

76
00:06:17,812 --> 00:06:19,873
[SPEAKER_01]: This again is in the International League now?

