[SPEAKER_00]: Well, yes.

78
00:06:21,013 --> 00:06:32,815
[SPEAKER_00]: I signed with the International League Club, but then when they found me to Lawrence of the New England League, that club up there only paid me $250 a month, but the Syracuse Club played the balance, which they had to do in baseball.

79
00:06:33,255 --> 00:06:44,337
[SPEAKER_00]: In fact, we were through up there, I would say Labor Day is when the season was over, and the International League season went on to about the end of September, so I got another

80
00:06:44,884 --> 00:06:47,265
[SPEAKER_00]: one or two checks until the end of their season.

81
00:06:49,626 --> 00:06:52,467
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay, now picking up with your first year with Cincinnati then.

82
00:06:52,487 --> 00:06:53,467
[SPEAKER_01]: They trained down here?

83
00:06:53,707 --> 00:06:55,428
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes, they trained here.

84
