86
00:07:03,331 --> 00:07:08,673
[SPEAKER_00]: It was built by a railroad man called Phil Plante.

87
00:07:09,293 --> 00:07:13,575
[SPEAKER_00]: He made a wonderful, wonderful building and beautiful rooms, large big

