00:07:14,197 --> 00:07:26,268
[SPEAKER_00]: big bedrooms, and we had it for two years, and then when we got out of there, we went to Orlando, and I was there, yeah, two years while I was there, and then the club moved to Orlando.

89
00:07:27,069 --> 00:07:32,154
[SPEAKER_00]: In fact, in that second year, I was traded from the Cincinnati Club to the Brooklyn Club.

90
00:07:32,174 --> 00:07:34,296
[SPEAKER_01]: Who was the Cincinnati manager, that Dan Howley?

91
00:07:34,316 --> 00:07:36,898
[SPEAKER_00]: Dan Howley was the manager, came from St. Louis Browns,

92
00:07:37,350 --> 00:07:40,092
[SPEAKER_00]: to take over for Sidney Weil in Cincinnati.

93
