103
00:08:15,203 --> 00:08:16,163
[SPEAKER_00]: That's what he kept telling me.

104
00:08:16,524 --> 00:08:25,689
[SPEAKER_00]: And then later on, oh, after about 20 or 30 swings, he said, now hit the ball as far as second base, second base, second, and then later on, inter-center field, inter-center.

105
00:08:26,009 --> 00:08:28,931
[SPEAKER_00]: The main thing was he wanted me to keep my eye on the ball, stay with it.

106
00:08:29,351 --> 00:08:36,716
[SPEAKER_00]: And from there on, I was put in the lineup two days later and went on to hit, I believe, 312 or 314, something like that.

107
00:08:36,736 --> 00:08:37,817
