108
00:08:38,017 --> 00:08:38,297
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

109
00:08:39,215 --> 00:08:50,643
[SPEAKER_01]: I have heard from other players that when rookies come up, oftentimes the old-timers don't give them much help because they're going to take their jobs away, maybe, and they kind of, you know, they just put them down a little bit.

110
