111
00:08:55,866 --> 00:08:59,649
[SPEAKER_00]: No, he was an outfielder anyway, but I can remember Dan Howley.

112
00:08:59,669 --> 00:09:01,250
[SPEAKER_00]: I didn't play too much in spring training.

113
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:04,532
[SPEAKER_00]: We had Charlie Dressen, who was the third baseman, and Joe Strip,

114
00:09:05,143 --> 00:09:22,605
[SPEAKER_00]: who was also a third baseman, first baseman, and we had George Kelly, Huey Crites, Horace Ford, and it was tough breaking in the lineup, but fortunately one of our first basemen got hurt and Dan Howley moved Joe Strip to first base and put me at third.

115
00:09:23,125 --> 00:09:26,568
[SPEAKER_00]: And I can remember him saying to me, now look, I want you to look into the bench.

116
00:09:27,108 --> 00:09:28,710
