159
00:11:33,503 --> 00:11:34,664
[SPEAKER_00]: I played third for a while.

160
00:11:35,104 --> 00:11:37,385
[SPEAKER_00]: Then they traded Huey Crites to New York.

161
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:51,069
[SPEAKER_00]: We got a first baseman infielder by the name of Crawford from the New York Giants, and then that's when Dan Howley moved me to second base, put Joe Strip at third base, and put Leo Durocher at shortstop.

162
00:11:51,489 --> 00:11:52,570
[SPEAKER_00]: Leo hadn't played too much.

163
00:11:52,950 --> 00:11:58,154
[SPEAKER_00]: Horace Ford was at shortstop, and when they got rid of Huey Price, that was the end of Horace Ford also.

164
00:11:59,595 --> 00:12:03,117
[SPEAKER_00]: But Leo was a real good help to me at second base also.

165
00:12:04,329 --> 00:12:06,390
