982
00:58:55,389 --> 00:58:56,830
[SPEAKER_00]: See, they didn't get into the big leagues around 48.

983
00:58:58,098 --> 00:58:59,098
[SPEAKER_01]: How did you feel about them?

984
00:58:59,118 --> 00:58:59,838
[SPEAKER_01]: They were pretty good?

985
00:58:59,998 --> 00:59:01,259
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh yeah, they were good ball.

986
00:59:01,279 --> 00:59:02,059
[SPEAKER_00]: We had some tough guys.

987
00:59:02,079 --> 00:59:07,360
[SPEAKER_00]: We had fellas on our club, and I was through as a major league ball player at the time, but my brother played.

988
00:59:07,420 --> 00:59:10,081
