997
00:59:32,121 --> 00:59:33,422
[SPEAKER_00]: And it was a tough league.

998
00:59:33,662 --> 00:59:37,443
[SPEAKER_00]: We played all the colored clubs, and they were real tough players.

999
00:59:37,943 --> 00:59:41,544
[SPEAKER_01]: Was there any feeling about it, playing with them or something like that?

1000
00:59:41,584 --> 00:59:42,704
[SPEAKER_00]: No, not whatsoever.

1001
00:59:42,765 --> 00:59:42,965
[SPEAKER_00]: No.

1002
00:59:43,225 --> 00:59:47,286
[SPEAKER_00]: In fact, around New York City at the time, we played with them and played against them.

1003
00:59:47,346 --> 00:59:47,566
[SPEAKER_00]: No.

1004
00:59:48,026 --> 00:59:48,806
[SPEAKER_00]: There was nothing at all.

1005
