[SPEAKER_00]: Luke Easter, Satchel Paige, Suitcase Simpson, a boy by the name of Troop, a catcher.

1013
01:00:15,179 --> 01:00:15,860
[SPEAKER_01]: Quincy Troop.

1014
01:00:16,320 --> 01:00:17,841
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, that's Quincy Troop, right.

1015
01:00:18,081 --> 01:00:18,461
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

1016
01:00:21,537 --> 01:00:25,140
[SPEAKER_01]: How did you do it during those 30 years in hitting?

