1030
01:01:13,098 --> 01:01:19,340
[SPEAKER_01]: When the club was owned by the Giants, would there be a kind of a business manager assigned to Jersey City?

1031
01:01:20,763 --> 01:01:23,964
[SPEAKER_00]: a general manager, he was also our road secretary.

1032
01:01:24,364 --> 01:01:29,806
