1045
01:02:39,020 --> 01:02:41,421
[SPEAKER_00]: I said, I'd like to use him in right field and stuff.

1046
01:02:41,781 --> 01:02:43,602
[SPEAKER_00]: He's supposed to go first to third, you know, and

