1049
01:02:49,692 --> 01:02:50,312
[SPEAKER_00]: What an arm.

1050
01:02:51,072 --> 01:02:55,953
[SPEAKER_00]: And he stayed with the Giants for a while and traded them to Boston I believe.

1051
01:02:57,334 --> 01:02:59,414
[SPEAKER_01]: How did you get over to Boston for 42?

