1053
01:03:01,975 --> 01:03:08,656
[SPEAKER_00]: That was the year that Mr. Terry and Stoneman got on the outs and Mellott was named manager.

1054
01:03:09,176 --> 01:03:14,197
[SPEAKER_00]: But Bill still was the head of the farm system and his friend Poncho Schneider,

1055
01:03:14,553 --> 01:03:19,115
