01:05:48,018 --> 01:05:49,459
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, Bob was with us.

1104
01:05:51,439 --> 01:05:59,681
[SPEAKER_01]: Now, this deal to Chicago, that was in... 1943, I believe I went there.

