1114
01:06:48,473 --> 01:06:49,674
[SPEAKER_00]: I went from there to Washington with him.

1115
01:06:50,134 --> 01:06:56,357
[SPEAKER_00]: And finally, I think the next town that I went to, he gave me a contract and dated it back to what it called, yeah.

1116
01:06:56,497 --> 01:06:58,798
