1119
01:07:03,267 --> 01:07:06,088
[SPEAKER_00]: But he took care of me and I finished out the season.

1120
01:07:06,209 --> 01:07:10,791
[SPEAKER_00]: I had a fair year the next year, but in 1945 I had a real good year.

1121
01:07:11,071 --> 01:07:14,513
