1125
01:07:23,586 --> 01:07:26,909
[SPEAKER_00]: I was up around 35-40 and I wound up 308.

1126
01:07:27,470 --> 01:07:31,894
[SPEAKER_00]: And Sternweiss beat me on 308.5, made it 309.

1127
01:07:33,055 --> 01:07:39,620
